@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Search & Query Insights
actor "User (Analyst)" as User
boundary QueryUI
control QueryEngine
entity SearchQuery
control KnowledgeStore
entity SearchHit

User -> QueryUI : enterQuery(text, filters)
QueryUI -> SearchQuery : createQuery(text, filters)
SearchQuery --> QueryUI : queryId
QueryUI -> QueryEngine : buildQuery(text, filters)
QueryEngine -> KnowledgeStore : retrieveHits(query)
KnowledgeStore --> QueryEngine : hits
QueryEngine -> QueryEngine : rankHits(hits)
QueryEngine -> SearchHit : displaySnippet()
SearchHit --> QueryEngine : ranked hits
QueryEngine --> QueryUI : showSearchHits(hits)
QueryUI --> User : display hits
@enduml